{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"241"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはどんな休みの日はどんな感じの私服なのですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服がアイドルぽいってのはよく言われるかなー\nどこかにぴんくが入っとる。意識しとるわけぢゃないけどぴんく入っとる(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"242"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが最初に握手してもらった人って、覚えていますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいー(ω)/\n初めての握手は、Perfumeさんが地元でやったインストアライブ!\nあのときも今も、謙虚な姿勢は変わってないPerfumeさん(*^^*)尊敬。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"243"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、個別に話し出来るのでしょうか？解ったら教えてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは当日までのお楽しみに(ゝω・)♪\nby.乃木坂46マネージャー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"244"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受験まであと数か月だけど、危機感ある？正直、僕はないよｗ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーああぁ。受験怖いです怖い怖い。\n全国の受験生のみなさん一緒に頑張ろー!おー(ω)/\nさゆりんごちゃん(松村沙友理chan)もブログで応援してくれとったよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"245"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分弁の言い回しも可愛いね♪せいたんに教わったのかな？\n次はいこまっちの秋田弁かな(^ω^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん(畠中清羅chan)やみさみさ(衛藤美彩chan)とお話ししよったら自然に覚えたー♪\nしらしんけん頑張るけん、ひめたんのこと応援しちょってな？\n(・∀・)どや\n秋田弁はなかなか難しそーう。いこまっち(生駒里奈chan)に習ってみます。\nがっこ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"246"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクールではお化粧までは教えてくれなかったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクールの発表会の時は、ままにメイクしてもらってました!\nあの時は「各自で」って言われてとったんですよ。\nでも乃木坂入ってみたら、みんなかわいいしメイク上手ぢゃし\nこりゃひめたんも頑張らんにゃって思いますよね(∀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"247"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年最初をサッカーから始めるなんて中元家はアグレッシブですね(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふふ(ω)\nサッカー「観戦」から始まるってことですよ^^\n新年のどの特番よりもサッカー観戦に燃えてるみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"248"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今東京にいるんだねぇ～正月くらいはゆっくりできるんかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月2日から活動開始です乃木坂46。\n頑張るぞー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"249"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは香水つけてる？つけてたらどこのか教えて///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"基本つけてないけど、ひめたんに染み込んだおうちの香りがお友達には好評(//ω//)\nたまーに、MARCJACOBSの香水とか使うかなー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"250"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんおれ魔法使いたいねんけどどうしたら使えるようになるかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったらひめたんが魔法使いになって、魔法が使えるようにしてあげるー(*/ω＼*)\nところで、ひめたん魔法使いたいねんけど、どうしたら使えるようになるかな。\n...あれ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"251"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのサイゼリアでオススメのメニュー教えてー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カルボナーラ(ω)!\nカルボナーラの美味しさは半端なーい♪\n庶民でごめんなさい。わら\n最近はカロリー抑えようと思って、お野菜もちゃんと食べますよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"252"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョイフルって西日本なんだ！\n以前、茨城に行った時にあったけど…さり気なく関東進出してるのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へ？そうなんですか？知らんかったー(・o・ノ)ノ!\n前にメンバーのみんなとジョナサン行った時に、\n西日本チームのみんなで大発見しちゃったんです♪\nうん。ジョイフル全国進出しちゃえー!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"253"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣行く？？\n254"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初詣は行くのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああ行ってない...。\n明日行ってもセーフですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"256"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の人はオタフクソースを何にでも入れるってホント？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これほんと。中でもひめたんのぱぱは異常です。\n揚げ物、目玉焼き、カレー...。\n何でも合うんだなこれが(*^^*)みなさんもお試しあれ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"257"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはコメントしている人の名前って覚えてるのかな！？\nもし覚えてくれてたら握手会で挨拶しようかな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手とかするときに名乗ってくださったら「あー!」ってなる(ω)♪\n挨拶してくださーい。待ってます★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"258"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"デビューシングルのオリコン初登場の順位は、ズバリ何位を狙ってる??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そりゃあやっぱり1位しかないぢゃろー(*/ω＼*)\nひめたんのままも買うって言っとったし♪うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"259"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"携帯に貼ってあるシールは何かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「もう我慢できません-I cannot endure It anymore-」\nわんちゃんがごはんを我慢してるイラストつきω\nぴったりぢゃーんって思ったから(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"260"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの部屋はどんな感じなのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー\n家具は赤と白でまとめてる!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"261"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真いつ撮ったの？ホテルで撮っているようにも見えるのだが…。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/24/himeka0037_2.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん(∀)!\n乃木坂の初期の初期!\nひめたん最近前髪分けとるんぢゃけど、\nぱっつんと分けとるのみなさんはどっちが好きですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"262"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初夢何か見ましたか～？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー覚えてない('・ω・`)\nしかもその日年賀状書いとってあんま寝とらん...\nうー来年こそは富士・鷹・なすび!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"263"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お正月といえばお年玉、ひめたんはもらったのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぱぱままの分は送ってもらったです♪\n親戚のみなさんには今年ご挨拶できんかった('・ω・`)←\nお年玉とかいらんけ会いたい!\n親戚のクッキーちゃんってヨーキーにも会いたーい!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"264"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんもお餅食べたかな？ひめたんはなに餅が好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お雑煮のお餅を２分の１こ食べた(・∀・)\nいつもはもっぱらきなこ餅派!ひめたんいっつも焼く係よーお♪\n電子レンジだって美味しく焼けるんぢゃけ。うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"265"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今気がついたんだけど、中元日芽香という名前に「元日」が入っているね☆\nすごく縁起のいい名前だね(^O^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中元日芽香...ほんまぢゃー!\n15年と8ヶ月半生きてて、始めて自分の名前の縁起の良さに気づいた瞬間。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"266"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お買い物に行って福袋を買ったのかな？\nお気に入りの洋服とかは入っていましたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福袋買いましたよ(^^)\nひなぴょん(川後陽菜chan)とおんなじ福袋かったら、中身がまったくおんなじだったー\nおそろいってことですね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"267"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんを妹にしたいのですが、いいですか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん(ω)♪\nいや、ひめたんの中ではすでにお兄さんお姉さんとお話ししとるつもりーふふふ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"268"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シングルイベントで個別があるけど、ひめたんに何回も行くと迷惑ですか？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然まったく!むしろ嬉しいーいいぃ♪♪\n何回も来てきてー!待ってますよー＼^^／\n楽しいお話いっぱいしたいな!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴんぽーん(∀)!\n乃木坂の初期の初期!\nひめたん最近前髪分けとるんぢゃけど、\nぱっつんと分けとるのみなさんはどっちが好きですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"269"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは乃木坂のテストで１番成績よかったので、勉強法とか聞きたいです\n全国の乃木坂応援してる受験生に、ひめたんから応援メッセージくださーい＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はいー。\nお勉強法かぁ。暗記系の科目だったら、オレンジのペンとかでノートまとめをして\n赤下敷きで隠す!スライドして覚える!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノートまとめで覚えて、さらに復習して頭にたたきこむ(`・・')\n受験生のみなさーんひめたんと一緒にステキな春を迎えましよーう♪\n体調崩したら遅れをとっちゃうから、無理はせんでね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"270"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のひめたんの目標は何ですか?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46としての活動が充実できるよう頑張る!\nステキな女子高生になる(*^^*)"}],"source":"archive"}